    "name": "Predge",
    "description": "Independent, bond-backed signed verdicts on whether an AI agent's paid job was delivered. An escrow reads the verdict before it releases or refunds, and every ruling is challengeable for 24 hours against a bond. Also publishes signed settlement-risk records for prediction markets through an x402 API.",
